@startuml
title UC-09 - View Deployment Status and Resource Graph
autonumber
actor Developer
boundary DeploymentQueryController as API
control DeploymentQueryService as Service
control DeploymentViewAssembler as Assembler
control OutputRedactor as Redactor
database DeploymentRepository as DeploymentRepo
database DeploymentSetRepository as SetRepo
database DeploymentResourceRepository as DeploymentResourceRepo
database ResourceTypeRepository as TypeRepo
database DeploymentWorkloadRepository as WorkloadRepo

Developer -> API: GetDeployment(appID, envID, deploymentID) [MS-01]
API -> Service: GetDeployment(ctx, query)
Service -> DeploymentRepo: FindScoped(query) [MS-02]
DeploymentRepo --> Service: Deployment + persisted plan
Service -> SetRepo: FindSnapshot(candidateSetID)
SetRepo --> Service: DeploymentSet
Service -> DeploymentResourceRepo: ListByDeployment(deploymentID) [MS-03]
DeploymentResourceRepo --> Service: Resource statuses + persisted output snapshots
Service -> TypeRepo: ListByOrganization(session.organization)
TypeRepo --> Service: Output classification contracts
Service -> WorkloadRepo: ListByDeployment(deploymentID)
WorkloadRepo --> Service: Workload statuses
Service -> Assembler: Assemble(all snapshots) [MS-04..MS-05]
Assembler --> Service: DeploymentView
Service -> Redactor: RedactSecretOutputs(view) [MS-06]
Redactor --> Service: Safe DeploymentView
Service --> API: DeploymentView [MS-07]
API --> Developer: Status + graph + non-secret outputs
@enduml
